# This repo publishes built artifacts whose source text is inlined (the client
# bundle's sourcemap carries `sourcesContent`), and scripts/build-client.mjs pins
# the region banner to a checkout-independent form. A CRLF checkout would still
# make a rebuild's lib/client.js.map differ from the committed one, so check out
# every text file with LF regardless of the platform's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
